  "n_polls": "REMOVED 2026-10-05. Every version of this artefact before that date carried a field called `n_polls` holding len(files) -- parquet partition files, not polls. Polling runs at 30 s and flushes every 5 minutes, so a file holds ten polls; the published 1,659 stood against 19,329 polls attempted over the same window, understating it by 11.7. The field is renamed to what it holds and the true counts are under `time`. The estimator never used it: it was descriptive, and wrong by an order of magnitude in public for three days."
